<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">ENTERPRISE WORKFLOWS</view><view class="title">审批、执行、复核，<view>串成完整责任链。</view></view><view class="subtitle">LangGraph 检查点 · 独立账号 · 持久化任务</view></view><view wx:if="{{!user}}" class="card"><view class="heading">连接企业工作流</view><input value="{{base}}" data-field="base" bindinput="input" placeholder="企业服务地址"/><input value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="input" placeholder="团队账号"/><input value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input" password="true" placeholder="密码"/><button bindtap="login">登录</button><view class="muted">先启动 Docker 工作流服务。登录令牌仅保存在本次运行内存中；手机需使用可访问的 HTTPS 合法域名。</view></view><block wx:else><view class="card"><view>{{user.username}} · {{user.role}}</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="refresh">刷新流程</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="logout">退出</button></view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{user.role!=='auditor'}}"><view class="heading">发起实际场地复核</view><input value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" placeholder="任务标题" maxlength="200"/><input value="{{facility}}" data-field="facility" bindinput="input" placeholder="实际设施 / 地点" maxlength="200"/><picker range="{{regions}}" range-key="label" value="{{regionIndex}}" bindchange="region"><view class="picker">{{regions[regionIndex].label}}　⌄</view></picker><textarea value="{{question}}" data-field="question" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="需要核对的问题"/><view class="row"><text>使用真实历史快照</text><switch checked="{{snapshot}}" data-field="snapshot" bindchange="mode"/></view><view class="row"><text>启用 DeepSeek Agent</text><switch checked="{{agent}}" data-field="agent" bindchange="mode"/></view><button bindtap="create">提交工作流</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">团队流程</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><view><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="badge">{{item.label}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.region}} · {{item.facility}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="empty">还没有实际工作流</view></view><block wx:if="{{selected}}"><view class="card"><view class="heading">{{selected.title}}</view><view class="badge">{{selected.label}} · 版本 {{selected.revision}}</view><view wx:if="{{selected.mode==='snapshot'}}" class="warning">历史快照流程，不代表当前天气。</view><view class="answer">{{selected.state.analysis||'后台正在取证或分析，请稍后刷新。'}}</view><view wx:if="{{actions.length}}"><textarea value="{{note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="input" maxlength="1200" placeholder="操作说明 / 审批意见（必填）"/><picker wx:if="{{selected.status==='waiting_approval'||((user.role==='admin'||user.role==='supervisor')&&selected.status==='waiting_field')}}" range="{{operators}}" range-key="username" value="{{operatorIndex}}" bindchange="operator"><view class="picker">执行人：{{operators[operatorIndex].username||'尚无现场执行人，请管理员先创建账号'}}　⌄</view></picker><block wx:if="{{selected.status==='waiting_field'}}"><textarea value="{{facts}}" data-field="facts" bindinput="input" maxlength="3000" placeholder="实际现场观察（必填）"/><checkbox-group bindchange="check"><label class="row"><checkbox value="0"/><text>来源及时间已核对</text></label><label class="row"><checkbox value="1"/><text>实际现场已检查</text></label><label class="row"><checkbox value="2"/><text>负责人及后续已确认</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="secondary" bindtap="photo">上传现场照片</button><view class="muted">本次已上传 {{uploaded.length}} 张照片</view></block><view class="actions"><button wx:for="{{actions}}" wx:key="action" data-action="{{item.action}}" bindtap="decide" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.label}}</button></view></view><view wx:else class="muted">由当前阶段授权成员继续操作。不能自我审批或越权代替执行人提交。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">真实证据与工具轨迹</view><view class="answer muted" selectable="true">{{trace}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">状态与审计记录</view><view wx:for="{{events}}" wx:key="id" class="row"><view><view>{{item.kind}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.stamp}}</view></view></view></view></block></block></view>
